==Strategy==
Due to the dangerous [[Wave Attack]]s produced by the Incubators in this stage, Cats with the [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immune]] or [[Wave Shield]] abilities are very useful here. If you don't have Cats with those abilities, you can try to spam [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] without meatshields so that the Incubators get knocked back and killed before they even get a chance to unleash their Wave Attacks.

For {{4c}}, don't even try this stage until you get [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]], as the heavily buffed Incubators will destroy your units. Your best bet is to get [[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat with Talents]], [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Speed Boosted Jiangshi Cat]], and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] is also helpful, assuming that you got Supercat so Slime can create Wave Attacks on the Incubators.

